#: ../../dev/dev.md:88
msgid "跨平台运行环境与视频依赖"
msgstr "Cross-platform environments and video dependencies"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:90
msgid ""
"推荐使用项目根目录的 `environment.yml` 创建环境。Windows、Linux 和 macOS 共用此文件；Conda 从 conda-"
"forge 安装对应平台的 FFmpeg、wxPython 和其他原生依赖，pip 复用项目的 `requirements.txt` 安装 Python"
" 依赖。环境文件不包含个人绝对路径或某个平台的构建编号。"
msgstr ""
"Create the recommended environment with `environment.yml` in the repository "
"root. Windows, Linux and macOS share this file. Conda installs platform-"
"specific FFmpeg, wxPython and other native dependencies from conda-forge; "
"pip reuses the project's `requirements.txt` for Python dependencies. The "
"environment file contains no personal absolute paths or platform-specific "
"build identifiers."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:92
msgid ""
"在项目根目录执行以下命令。若已有同名环境，可用 `conda env create -n mulimgviewer-new -f "
"environment.yml` 创建新环境；不要为了安装视频工具而覆盖已有环境。"
msgstr ""
"Run the following commands from the repository root. If an environment with "
"the same name already exists, create a separate environment with `conda env "
"create -n mulimgviewer-new -f environment.yml`; do not replace an existing "
"environment just to install video tools."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:101
msgid ""
"macOS 的 Conda wxPython 可能需要框架启动器：在该环境安装 `conda install -c conda-forge "
"python.app`，然后使用 `pythonw MulimgViewer.py` 启动 GUI。工具检测脚本仍使用 `python`。参见 "
"[wxPython 官方说明](https://www.wxpython.org/pages/downloads/)。"
msgstr ""
"Conda wxPython on macOS may require a framework launcher: install `conda "
"install -c conda-forge python.app` in that environment and start the GUI "
"with `pythonw MulimgViewer.py`. Continue to use `python` for the tool "
"checker. See the [official wxPython "
"instructions](https://www.wxpython.org/pages/downloads/)."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:103
msgid ""
"只需为已有环境补装视频工具时，执行 `conda install -n mulimgviewer -c conda-forge "
"ffmpeg`，并使用该环境的 Python 运行 "
"`tools/check_video_tools.py`。此脚本会输出实际解释器和两个工具的路径、执行版本检查，失败时以非零状态退出；`ffmpeg-"
"python` 是调用封装，不能代替 FFmpeg 和 FFprobe 可执行程序。"
msgstr ""
"To add video tools to an existing environment, run `conda install -n "
"mulimgviewer -c conda-forge ffmpeg`, then run `tools/check_video_tools.py` "
"with that environment's Python. The checker prints the interpreter and both "
"executable paths, checks their versions, and exits with a nonzero status on "
"failure. `ffmpeg-python` is a calling wrapper; it does not replace the "
"FFmpeg and FFprobe executables."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:105
msgid ""
"工具查找顺序为：`FFMPEG_BINARY` / `FFPROBE_BINARY` 显式设置、当前 Python 环境、系统 "
"PATH、平台常见目录、可选的 `tools/ffmpeg/bin`、当前环境登记的同版本 Conda 包缓存。Windows 使用 `.exe` 与 "
"`Library/bin`；Linux/macOS 使用无扩展名程序与 `bin`。过期的 `CONDA_PREFIX` "
"不会覆盖实际运行的解释器。程序只为子进程构造依赖搜索路径，不修改系统 PATH，不自动安装或下载软件。"
msgstr ""
"Tool lookup order is: explicit `FFMPEG_BINARY` / `FFPROBE_BINARY` settings, "
"the running Python environment, system PATH, common platform locations, "
"optional `tools/ffmpeg/bin`, and the matching Conda package cache recorded "
"for the current environment. Windows uses `.exe` and `Library/bin`; "
"Linux/macOS use extensionless executables and `bin`. A stale `CONDA_PREFIX` "
"does not override the running interpreter. The application constructs "
"dependency search paths only for child processes, without changing system "
"PATH or automatically installing or downloading software."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:107
msgid ""
"`tools/ffmpeg/bin` 只是便携部署的可选兜底，不是运行所必需的目录，也不能把 Windows 的 `.exe` 分发给 "
"Linux/macOS 使用。该目录中的本机二进制已加入 Git 忽略规则。Conda 安装和环境管理方式参见 [conda-forge "
"FFmpeg](https://anaconda.org/channels/conda-forge/packages/ffmpeg) 和 [Conda "
"环境文档](https://docs.conda.io/projects/conda/en/stable/user-guide/tasks"
"/manage-environments.html)。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/ffmpeg/bin` is an optional fallback for portable deployments, not a "
"required runtime directory. Windows `.exe` files cannot be distributed as "
"Linux/macOS executables. Local binaries in that directory are ignored by "
"Git. For installation and environment management, see [conda-forge "
"FFmpeg](https://anaconda.org/channels/conda-forge/packages/ffmpeg) and the "
"[Conda environment "
"documentation](https://docs.conda.io/projects/conda/en/stable/user-"
"guide/tasks/manage-environments.html)."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:109
msgid ""
"如果包记录显示 FFmpeg 已安装，但文件缺失，可执行 `conda install -n mulimgviewer -c conda-forge "
"--force-reinstall ffmpeg` 后重新检测。若文件再次消失或启动被拒绝，需要检查本机的文件删除、隔离或权限原因；仅重新配置 PATH"
" 无法修复缺失的程序。"
msgstr ""
"If the package record says FFmpeg is installed but files are missing, run "
"`conda install -n mulimgviewer -c conda-forge --force-reinstall ffmpeg` and "
"check again. If files disappear again or execution is denied, investigate "
"local deletion, quarantine or permission issues; changing PATH alone cannot "
"restore a missing executable."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:111
msgid ""
"`.github/workflows/video-environment.yml` 在 Windows、Linux、macOS "
"上从该环境文件安装依赖，检查 FFmpeg/FFprobe 能否启动、原生 Python 依赖能否导入，并执行不依赖 GUI "
"的工具查找测试。这些检查不等同于三平台完整 GUI 回归；完整功能回归仍使用下面的入口执行。"
msgstr ""
"`.github/workflows/video-environment.yml` installs dependencies from this "
"environment file on Windows, Linux and macOS, checks that FFmpeg/FFprobe "
"launch and native Python dependencies import, and runs tool-discovery tests "
"without a GUI. These checks do not constitute a full three-platform GUI "
"regression; use the entry point below for complete functional regression "
"testing."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:113
msgid "开发回归测试与 PR 审查"
msgstr "Development regression testing and PR review"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:115
msgid "开发新功能或修复问题时，请按下面的顺序检查已有功能，并把对应的测试报告附在 PR 中，方便维护者审查。"
msgstr ""
"When developing a feature or fixing an issue, follow these steps to check existing "
"functionality and attach the corresponding test report to your PR for maintainer "
"review."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:117
msgid "第 1 步：进入项目并确认 Python 环境"
msgstr "Step 1: Open the project and confirm the Python environment"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:119
msgid ""
"在项目根目录打开终端，此目录应包含 `MulimgViewer.py`、`src` 和 `auto_test_scripts`。使用能够正常启动软件的 Python "
"环境；如果使用 Conda，将下面的环境名称替换为自己的名称。"
msgstr ""
"Open a terminal in the repository root, which should contain `MulimgViewer.py`, "
"`src`, and `auto_test_scripts`. Use a Python environment that can run the "
"application. If you use Conda, replace the environment name below with your own."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:126
msgid "下面的测试命令均从项目根目录执行。测试使用独立进程和临时目录，不需要开发者提供自己的图片、视频或个人配置。"
msgstr ""
"Run the following test commands from the repository root. Tests use isolated "
"processes and temporary directories; developers do not need to provide personal "
"images, videos, or configuration files."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:128
msgid "第 2 步：安装依赖并准备视频工具"
msgstr "Step 2: Install dependencies and prepare the video tools"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:134
msgid "视频测试还需要 FFmpeg 和 FFprobe。如果当前环境没有这两个工具，使用 Conda 的开发者可以执行："
msgstr ""
"Video tests also require FFmpeg and FFprobe. If these tools are missing from your "
"environment, Conda users can run:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:140
msgid "测试入口会使用软件的视频工具定位机制检查依赖。依赖缺失时会生成失败报告，不能视为测试通过。"
msgstr ""
"The test runner checks dependencies using the application's video-tool discovery "
"mechanism. Missing dependencies produce a failed report and do not count as a "
"successful test run."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:142
msgid ""
"Windows 也可以在已激活的环境中双击 `auto_test_scripts/run_tests.cmd`。如果双击时使用了错误的 Python，可在 "
"PowerShell 中指定解释器；把示例路径替换为自己的路径。"
msgstr ""
"On Windows, you can also double-click `auto_test_scripts/run_tests.cmd` after "
"activating the environment. If this uses the wrong Python interpreter, specify it in "
"PowerShell, replacing the example path with your own."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:149
msgid ""
"Linux 和 macOS 可使用同一个 Python 入口，或执行 `sh auto_test_scripts/run_tests.sh`。GUI "
"测试需要图形会话；无显示器的 Linux 环境在安装 Xvfb 后使用："
msgstr ""
"Linux and macOS can use the same Python entry point or run `sh "
"auto_test_scripts/run_tests.sh`. GUI tests require a graphical session. On headless "
"Linux, install Xvfb and run:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:155
msgid "第 3 步：执行完整回归测试"
msgstr "Step 3: Run the complete regression suite"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:161
msgid ""
"等待所有模块结束，确认最终状态为 `PASSED`，且命令退出码为 0。执行通常需要几分钟。`--strict-skips` "
"要求没有跳过的案例；失败、异常、缺少依赖、超时或跳过都会使本次严格检查不通过。"
msgstr ""
"Wait for every module to finish, then confirm that the final status is `PASSED` and "
"the command exits with code 0. A run usually takes a few minutes. `--strict-skips` "
"requires zero skipped cases; failures, exceptions, missing dependencies, timeouts, or"
" skips make this strict check fail."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:163
msgid ""
"执行期间不要修改源码、测试脚本和固定素材，也不要在同一份工作目录同时启动多次全量测试。报告记录提交 "
"SHA、未提交改动，以及源码、测试和素材的指纹；运行期间发生变化时，需要重新执行。"
msgstr ""
"Do not modify source code, tests, or fixed fixtures during a run, or start multiple "
"full runs in the same working directory. The report records the commit SHA, "
"uncommitted changes, and fingerprints of the source, tests, and fixtures. Rerun the "
"suite if they change during execution."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:165
msgid ""
"回归范围包括图像和视频播放、四种输入模式、并行与顺序组合、布局与标题、自定义算法、两层缓存、索引与状态栏、配置恢复，以及七种输出组合、三种保存格式、后台保存和暂停续存。固定"
" PNG、自定义处理和拼接结果使用像素比较，视频解码结果使用已知帧校验。"
msgstr ""
"Regression coverage includes image and video playback, all four input modes, parallel"
" and sequential combinations, layouts and titles, custom algorithms, two-level "
"caching, the index and status bar, configuration restoration, seven output "
"combinations, three export formats, background saving, and pause/resume. Fixed PNGs, "
"processed images, and mosaics are compared by pixels; decoded video frames are "
"checked against known references."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:167
msgid ""
"固定素材位于 `auto_test_scripts/assets`，包含小型图像、视频、相对路径列表和期望结果，合计约 38 "
"KB。测试不会在正常执行时自动重建期望结果。既有 Windows 验证记录位于 "
"`auto_test_scripts/baseline/verified.json`；实际案例数量以本次报告为准。"
msgstr ""
"Fixed fixtures are stored in `auto_test_scripts/assets`: small images, videos, "
"relative-path file lists, and expected outputs totaling approximately 38 KB. Normal "
"test runs never regenerate expected outputs automatically. The existing Windows "
"verification record is in `auto_test_scripts/baseline/verified.json`; use the current"
" report for the actual case count."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:169
msgid "第 4 步：打开报告并确认结果"
msgstr "Step 4: Open the report and verify the results"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:171
msgid ""
"每次执行生成 `auto_test_scripts/reports/<UTC时间>/`。读取 "
"`auto_test_scripts/reports/latest.json` 的 `directory` 字段，即可找到最近一次执行的目录。Windows "
"PowerShell 可执行："
msgstr ""
"Each run creates `auto_test_scripts/reports/<UTC timestamp>/`. Read the `directory` "
"field in `auto_test_scripts/reports/latest.json` to locate the most recent run. In "
"Windows PowerShell, run:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "文件"
msgstr "File"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "用途"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`report.html`"
msgstr "`report.html`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "查看功能分组、案例状态、参数子案例和错误堆栈。"
msgstr "Inspect feature groups, case statuses, parameterized subcases, and tracebacks."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`report.json`"
msgstr "`report.json`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "核对提交、源码指纹、测试环境和完整结果。"
msgstr "Verify the commit, source fingerprint, test environment, and complete results."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`junit.xml`"
msgstr "`junit.xml`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "供 CI 和 JUnit 工具解析结果。"
msgstr "Provide results for CI and JUnit-compatible tools."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`summary.md`"
msgstr "`summary.md`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "查看失败、跳过和环境错误摘要。"
msgstr "Review the summary of failures, skips, and environment errors."

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "`test_*.log`"
msgstr "`test_*.log`"

#: ../../dev/dev.md
msgid "查看对应测试模块的执行日志。"
msgstr "Read the execution log for the corresponding test module."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:187
msgid ""
"`PASSED` 表示本次选择的案例全部通过，`PASSED_WITH_SKIPS` 表示存在跳过，`FAILED` "
"表示检查未通过。审查完整回归时，还要确认没有未执行的模块、功能分组均完成验证。仅运行部分案例得到的通过结果，不能代替全量报告。"
msgstr ""
"`PASSED` means all selected cases passed, `PASSED_WITH_SKIPS` means some cases were "
"skipped, and `FAILED` means the check failed. When reviewing a full regression run, "
"also confirm that no modules were left unexecuted and all feature groups were fully "
"verified. A passing subset cannot replace a complete report."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:189
msgid "第 5 步：定位失败并重新验证"
msgstr "Step 5: Diagnose failures and verify the fix"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:191
msgid "先在 HTML 报告中找到失败案例及其输入模式、输出组合、布局和格式，再查看同名模块的日志。可用下面的命令缩小范围："
msgstr ""
"Find the failed case and its input mode, output combination, layout, and format in "
"the HTML report, then inspect that module's log. Use these commands to narrow the "
"investigation:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:199
msgid "也可以重跑某份报告中的失败案例。在已经执行第 4 步的 PowerShell 终端中运行："
msgstr ""
"You can also rerun the failed cases from a report. In the PowerShell terminal where "
"you completed Step 4, run:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:205
msgid "先区分产品错误、过期的测试假设和环境问题，再处理失败。不要通过删除断言、把失败改成跳过或自动覆盖期望图片来获得通过结果。修复后必须再次执行第 3 步的全量严格检查。"
msgstr ""
"Distinguish product defects, outdated test assumptions, and environment problems "
"before fixing a failure. Do not obtain a passing result by deleting assertions, "
"turning failures into skips, or automatically overwriting expected images. After "
"fixing the problem, repeat the full strict check in Step 3."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:207
msgid "第 6 步：为代码修改补充测试"
msgstr "Step 6: Add tests for your code changes"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:209
msgid ""
"新增案例放在 `auto_test_scripts/cases/test_*.py`，使用 unittest；入口会自动发现。多个输入、布局和输出组合应使用带明确参数的 "
"`subTest`，使失败报告能够定位具体组合。同步更新 `auto_test_scripts/coverage.json` 中的功能映射。"
msgstr ""
"Add unittest cases under `auto_test_scripts/cases/test_*.py`; the runner discovers "
"them automatically. Use `subTest` with explicit parameters for input, layout, and "
"output combinations so that failure reports identify the exact combination. Update "
"the feature mapping in `auto_test_scripts/coverage.json` as well."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:211
msgid "测试应使用固定素材或私有临时副本，避免依赖个人绝对路径、网络和用户文件。新增异步功能应检查任务依赖、内存准入、暂停、取消和关闭清理；新增保存功能应检查文件内容、实际格式和目录结构。"
msgstr ""
"Tests should use fixed fixtures or private temporary copies, avoiding personal "
"absolute paths, network access, and user files. For asynchronous features, check task"
" dependencies, memory admission, pause, cancellation, and shutdown cleanup. For "
"export features, check file contents, actual encodings, and directory structure."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:213
msgid ""
"只有在明确修改了素材规范时，才运行 `python auto_test_scripts/generate_assets.py`。同时审查素材生成规则、输入、期望结果和 "
"`manifest.json` 的变化，避免把错误输出当作新的正确答案。"
msgstr ""
"Run `python auto_test_scripts/generate_assets.py` only when intentionally changing "
"the fixture specification. Review the generation rules, inputs, expected outputs, and"
" changes to `manifest.json` together to avoid treating incorrect output as a new "
"reference."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:215
msgid "第 7 步：提交 PR 并附上测试报告"
msgstr "Step 7: Submit the PR with its test report"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:217
msgid "提交前确认代码和测试已经完成修改，再执行全量严格检查。PR 中说明修改目的、受影响功能、新增案例及仍需人工检查的项目，并填写 PR 模板中的回归验证部分。"
msgstr ""
"Finish editing the code and tests before running the full strict suite. Describe the "
"purpose of the change, affected features, added cases, and remaining manual checks in"
" the PR, and complete the regression-verification section of the PR template."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:219
msgid ""
"提交 PR 后，在 GitHub Actions 中打开 **Functional regression report** 工作流，确认 `windows-"
"regression` 任务通过，并下载对应提交的报告产物。把该次 CI 执行或产物的链接附在 PR 中；如果提供本地报告，应将 HTML、JSON、JUnit "
"和模块日志打包附上。"
msgstr ""
"After submitting the PR, open the **Functional regression report** workflow in GitHub"
" Actions, confirm that the `windows-regression` job passed, and download the report "
"artifact for that commit. Include a link to the CI run or artifact in the PR. If "
"providing a local report, attach an archive containing the HTML, JSON, JUnit, and "
"module logs."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:221
msgid ""
"自动生成的 `auto_test_scripts/reports` 已被 Git 忽略，不需要把每次日志提交到仓库。`baseline/verified.json` "
"是既有基线，不能替代本次 PR 的报告。代码再次修改后，需要重新运行测试并更新报告链接。"
msgstr ""
"Generated files under `auto_test_scripts/reports` are ignored by Git; do not commit "
"logs from every run. `baseline/verified.json` is an existing baseline and cannot "
"replace the report for this PR. After any further code changes, rerun the tests and "
"update the report link."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:223
msgid ""
"维护者审查时，依次核对报告是否对应 PR 的最新提交、是否完成全量检查、失败和跳过是否得到解释，以及本次修改是否补充了相关案例。仓库管理员可在分支保护或仓库规则中，将 "
"`windows-regression` 设为必需检查，从而阻止测试失败的 PR 合并。"
msgstr ""
"Maintainers should verify that the report matches the PR's latest commit, the full "
"suite ran, failures and skips are explained, and relevant cases were added for the "
"change. Repository administrators can make `windows-regression` a required check in "
"branch protection or repository rules to prevent merging PRs with failing tests."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:225
msgid ""
"目前 CI 工作流配置为 Windows。Linux/macOS、实际 GPU 驱动与硬件、系统对话框外观及长时间运行仍应根据修改范围补充验证。详细案例和维护规则见 "
"`auto_test_scripts/README.md`。"
msgstr ""
"The current CI workflow targets Windows. Add verification for Linux/macOS, physical "
"GPU drivers and hardware, native dialog appearance, and long-running sessions as "
"required by the changes. See `auto_test_scripts/README.md` for detailed cases and "
"maintenance rules."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:227
msgid "Readme | Translation"
msgstr "Readme | Translation"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:228
msgid "当您提出一个issue，或者决定参与该项目的开发，可以添加到[todo.md](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/blob/master/docs/misc/todo.md)."
msgstr ""
"When you raise an issue or decide to contribute to this project, you can add it to "
"[todo.md](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/blob/master/docs/misc/todo.md)."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:229
msgid "当您完成一个功能的时候，可以在issue中添加该功能的`md`说明。在下一个版本release的时候，我们会更新`docs`（仅包含最新release版本的功能介绍）。"
msgstr ""
"When you complete a feature, you can add the `md` description of that feature to the "
"issue. When the next version is released, we will update the docs (which only contain"
" the feature introduction for the latest **release** version)."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:230
msgid "当您完成一个功能的时候，可以添加到[acknowledgements.md](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/blob/master/docs/misc/acknowledgements.md)."
msgstr ""
"When you complete a feature, you can add it to "
"[acknowledgements.md](https://github.com/nachifur/MulimgViewer/blob/master/docs/misc/acknowledgements.md)."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:232
msgid "第 1 步：修改中文源文档"
msgstr "Step 1: Edit the Chinese source document"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:234
msgid ""
"从项目根目录编辑需要更新的 Markdown 文件，例如 `docs/dev/dev.md`。中文源文档是维护入口；英文版本通过 Sphinx "
"的语言目录生成，不需要再维护一份独立的英文 Markdown 副本。"
msgstr ""
"From the repository root, edit the Markdown document you want to update, such as "
"`docs/dev/dev.md`. Maintain the Chinese source; Sphinx generates the English version "
"from its language catalog, so no separate English Markdown copy is needed."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:240
msgid "第 2 步：生成并更新英文 PO 词条"
msgstr "Step 2: Generate and update the English PO entries"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:242
msgid "在同一个 Python 环境安装文档工具，然后进入 `docs` 目录执行："
msgstr ""
"Install the documentation tools in the same Python environment, then enter the `docs`"
" directory and run:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:251
msgid ""
"这些命令会自动提取中文并更新 PO 词条，不会自动完成英文翻译。开发指南对应的文件是 "
"`docs/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/dev/dev.po`。已有翻译会保留，新增或修改的内容需要补充或核对英文。"
msgstr ""
"These commands automatically extract the Chinese text and update PO entries; they do "
"not translate the text into English. The development guide's catalog is "
"`docs/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/dev/dev.po`. Existing translations are preserved; add or "
"review the English for new or changed content."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:253
msgid "使用 `_build` 保存生成文件，避免把构建产物当作文档源文件再次扫描。`python -m` 能确保构建命令使用当前激活的 Python 环境。"
msgstr ""
"Use `_build` for generated files so that build output is not scanned again as "
"documentation source. `python -m` ensures that build commands use the currently "
"activated Python environment."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:255
msgid "第 3 步：填写对应的英文翻译"
msgstr "Step 3: Fill in the corresponding English translations"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:257
msgid "保持在 `docs` 目录，编辑对应的 PO 文件："
msgstr "Stay in the `docs` directory and edit the corresponding PO file:"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:263
msgid ""
"保留 `msgid` 中的中文原文，在 `msgstr` 中填写英文。保留命令、文件路径、格式名称和参数名称；检查 Markdown 链接和代码标记。带 `fuzzy` "
"标记的词条需要人工确认，确认后移除该标记，否则构建时可能继续显示中文。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the Chinese source in `msgid` and write the English translation in `msgstr`. "
"Preserve commands, file paths, format names, and parameter names; check Markdown "
"links and code markup. Review entries marked `fuzzy` and remove that flag after "
"confirming the translation, otherwise the build may continue to display Chinese."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:270
msgid "第 4 步：构建并检查英文页面"
msgstr "Step 4: Build and inspect the English page"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:277
msgid ""
"打开 "
"`docs/_build/html/en/dev/dev.html`，确认新增章节显示英文，操作步骤、命令和表格完整。检查构建日志中的错误及与本次修改相关的警告；生成 "
"PO 成功不代表翻译已经完成。"
msgstr ""
"Open `docs/_build/html/en/dev/dev.html` and confirm that the new sections appear in "
"English and that the steps, commands, and tables are complete. Check build errors and"
" warnings related to your changes; successfully generating PO files does not mean "
"translation is complete."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:279
msgid ""
"如果出现 `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'mulimgviewer'`，请先从项目根目录执行 `python -m pip "
"install -e .`，再回到 `docs` 目录重新构建。"
msgstr ""
"If you encounter `ModuleNotFoundError: No module named 'mulimgviewer'`, first run "
"`python -m pip install -e .` from the repository root, then return to `docs` and "
"rebuild."

#: ../../dev/dev.md:281
msgid "第 5 步：提交文档和对应翻译"
msgstr "Step 5: Commit the document and its translation"

#: ../../dev/dev.md:283
msgid ""
"把修改后的 Markdown 与对应 PO 文件一起提交，例如 `docs/dev/dev.md` 和 "
"`docs/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/dev/dev.po`。检查暂存差异，保留无关文档的既有翻译；不要提交 `_build`、生成的 MO "
"文件或本地测试日志。"
msgstr ""
"Commit the edited Markdown and its corresponding PO file together, for example "
"`docs/dev/dev.md` and `docs/locale/en/LC_MESSAGES/dev/dev.po`. Review the staged diff"
" and preserve existing translations for unrelated documents. Do not commit `_build`, "
"generated MO files, or local test logs."

